      {
         "id": "c",
         "prompt": "At time \\( t = 60 \\) the phone is unplugged and used. For \\( 60 \\le t \\le 120 \\), the battery level decreases at a rate modeled by \\( u(t) = 0.6 + 0.25\\sin\\left(\\frac{t}{8}\\right) \\) percent per minute. Find the battery level at time \\( t = 120 \\).",
