         "answer_latex": "B(120) \\approx 55.132",
         "worked_solution": [
            {
               "text": "The level at t = 60 is the starting level plus the charge gained while plugged in.",
               "latex": "B(60) = 18 + \\int_{0}^{60} c(t)\\,dt \\approx 93.345"
            },
            {
               "text": "From t = 60 to t = 120 the level falls by the integral of u.",
               "latex": "B(120) = B(60) - \\int_{60}^{120} u(t)\\,dt"
